  "description": "Our top of the range Falco road bike is lightweight and fast with everything you need for long days in the saddle or turning up the speed in the club sprint.\nThe 6061 hydroformed frame and aerodynamic carbon fork make for a stiff and efficient ride. With internal headset and cabling the Elite cuts a mean shape to match is excellent performance.\nEquipped with Shimano 105 22 speed gearing shifting is effortless and precise. Drivetrain is comprised of FSA semi compact 52/36t crankset with external bottom bracket matched to an 11-32t cassette, maximising power transfer whilst shedding weight. Tektro dual pivot brake calipers take care of the stopping and keep the weight down.\nMaxxis M225 28c tyres give enhanced grip and cushioning to give confident road holding. Mounted on Alex At470 tubeless compatible 28 spoke wheels you’ll notice the impressive acceleration and climbing ability of the wheelset.\nThe Falco Elite is both a bike for those wanting to take the next step in road cycling and for the purists. Watch out…… its fast!",
